    "multi_column_bJtgmc": {
      "type": "multi-column",
      "blocks": {
        "item_mRFw4X": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "picto-target",
            "icon_width": 32,
            "icon_background_type": "square",
            "icon_background": "#a0b842",
            "icon_color": "#ffffff",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": "",
            "border_color": "#a0b842",
            "show_controls": false,
            "column_size": "2",
            "title": "",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "subheading": "",
            "content": "<h4>Cole Haan Japan</h4><p>Premium Footwear & Accessories • Multiple formats</p><p>Required insights connected to selling behavior, fixture performance, and POS data. Different store formats made measurement inconsistent, and department store shops could not measure visitors.</p><h6></h6><h6>KEY RESULTS</h6><ul><li>Company-wide dashboards increased alignment</li><li>Store staff could see discrepancies between intuition and data</li><li>Gender and age attributes supported merchandising decisions</li></ul>",
            "link_url": "#",
            "link_text": "View details →",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "item_r96Tt7": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "picto-target",
            "icon_width": 32,
            "icon_background_type": "square",
            "icon_background": "#a0b842",
            "icon_color": "#ffffff",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": "",
            "border_color": "#a0b842",
            "show_controls": false,
            "column_size": "2",
            "title": "",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "subheading": "",
            "content": "<h4>Baycrews</h4><p>Fashion • Multi-Brand • Multiple locations</p><p>Implemented Flow early to support data-driven store operations across major brands and stores. Required group-wide visibility and role-specific dashboards.</p><h6></h6><h6>KEY RESULTS</h6><ul><li>Group-wide visibility of visitor counts</li><li>Clear identification of new store performance and conversion challenges</li><li>Dashboards tailored to role level: store, manager, executive</li></ul>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "View details →",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "item_KQtcVQ": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "picto-target",
            "icon_width": 32,
            "icon_background_type": "square",
            "icon_background": "#a0b842",
            "icon_color": "#ffffff",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": "",
            "border_color": "#a0b842",
            "show_controls": false,
            "column_size": "2",
            "title": "",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "subheading": "",
            "content": "<h4>Triumph International Japan</h4><p>Intimate Apparel • Multiple locations</p><p>Previously used a visitor counting system but found the support and UI insufficient. Staff could not easily interpret the data.</p><h6></h6><h6>KEY RESULTS</h6><ul><li>Data available in real-time instead of one day later</li><li>UI clarity allowed store staff to interpret KPI movement</li><li>Information sharing from HQ to stores accelerated</li></ul>",
            "link_url": "#",
            "link_text": "View details →",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "item_jHGFzb": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "picto-target",
            "icon_width": 32,
            "icon_background_type": "square",
            "icon_background": "#a0b842",
            "icon_color": "#ffffff",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": "",
            "border_color": "#a0b842",
            "show_controls": false,
            "column_size": "2",
            "title": "",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "subheading": "",
            "content": "<h4>TUMI Japan</h4><p>Premium Luggage & Accessories • Multiple locations</p><p>Pursues store-level DX. Combines fixed counters with Flow Clicker for stores where sensors cannot be installed.</p><h6></h6><h6>KEY RESULTS</h6><ul><li>Managers gained clearer understanding through visualized KPIs</li><li>Clicker automation reduced manual counting burden</li><li>Staff began documenting qualitative explanations in Pulse</li></ul>",
            "link_url": "#",
            "link_text": "View details →",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "item_KeN4HJ": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "picto-target",
            "icon_width": 32,
            "icon_background_type": "square",
            "icon_background": "#a0b842",
            "icon_color": "#ffffff",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": "",
            "border_color": "#a0b842",
            "show_controls": false,
            "column_size": "2",
            "title": "",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "subheading": "",
            "content": "<h4>Global Jeans Brand</h4><p>Denim • VMD Optimization • Multiple locations</p><p>Major global denim brand sought to optimize VMD performance in multi-brand retail environments. Focused on identifying which fixture layouts produce higher engagement and conversion.</p><h6></h6><h6>KEY RESULTS</h6><ul><li>Identified optimal fixture placements</li><li>Improved engagement through layout adjustments</li><li>Standardized best practices across stores</li></ul>",
            "link_url": "#",
            "link_text": "View details →",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "item_kGDkaE": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "picto-target",
            "icon_width": 32,
            "icon_background_type": "square",
            "icon_background": "#a0b842",
            "icon_color": "#ffffff",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": "",
            "border_color": "#a0b842",
            "show_controls": false,
            "column_size": "2",
            "title": "",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "subheading": "",
            "content": "<h4>Company-Wide Flow Deployment Impact</h4><p>Aggregate Analysis • Multiple customers</p><p>Flow examined performance across multiple customers who adopted Flow. Analysis shows significant outperformance vs. partial adopters and industry average.</p><h6></h6><h6>KEY RESULTS</h6><ul><li>2024: customers using Flow saw YoY sales growth of 108.9%</li><li>2023: companies deploying Flow in all stores achieved 108.5% YoY growth</li><li>Outperformed partial adopters and broader industry average</li></ul>",
            "link_url": "#",
            "link_text": "View details →",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
